- EagleScoutz
	After raiding EagleScoutz home, police were able to find all of the stolen games. 
	EagleScoutz confessed, stating that he had been orchestrating his fans to get the newest and most popular games for him as a youtube challenge in order to prevent other youtubers from getting access to them. 
	“The only thing I’m really guilty of is my passion for video games.” The infamous YouTuber is now serving his sentence in prison and in therapy to deal with the lack of video games. 
